{
  "slug": "skill-provenance",
  "name": "Skill Provenance",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Version tracking for Agent Skills bundles across sessions, surfaces, and platforms. When you load a skill into a new session, Skill Provenance reads the manifest, verifies file hashes, flags stale evals, and tells you what needs attention. When you save, it bumps versions, recomputes hashes, and updates the changelog. Works anywhere the agentskills.io standard does (30+ agent tools).",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `bootstrap` (Add version tracking to an existing unversioned skill bundle), `close` (Update version tracking when finishing work on a skill bundle), `handoff` (Generate a handoff note summarizing skill project state for a future session or collaborator), `open` (Verify a skill bundle's integrity when opening a project), `validate` (Run a focused validation check for a skill bundle)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install skill-provenance@claude-community` from `snapsynapse/skill-provenance`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
  "sourceType": "community",
